WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.634 --> 00:00:03.236
-Congratulations on the film.
You´re reprising your role

00:00:03.236 --> 00:00:05.305 align:start size:94% position:6%
of Alfred the butler.
-Yeah.

00:00:05.305 --> 00:00:07.140 align:start size:94% position:6%
-But you´re not very butlery
in this.

00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:09.342 align:start size:94% position:6%
You´re very technologically
savvy, your Alfred.

00:00:09.342 --> 00:00:12.278 size:81% position:41%
-Yeah. Well, you know,
we wanted to move on.

00:00:12.278 --> 00:00:15.415 align:start size:94% position:6%
When Zack Snyder took over
"Batman" as director,

00:00:15.415 --> 00:00:18.218 size:75% position:38%
we wanted to move on
from the silver tray

00:00:18.218 --> 00:00:21.154
and the, you know, all of that
business, and the washing up.

00:00:21.154 --> 00:00:24.824 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I --

00:00:24.824 --> 00:00:27.327
I mean, the whole world is
getting more technological.

00:00:27.327 --> 00:00:27.994 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.

00:00:27.994 --> 00:00:31.598 align:start size:94% position:6%
-But I wanted to --

00:00:31.598 --> 00:00:35.969
I suddenly remembered going to
dinner with John Paul Getty,

00:00:35.969 --> 00:00:37.604
who I suppose -- he´s dead now.

00:00:37.604 --> 00:00:39.305
Just about two years ago.

00:00:39.305 --> 00:00:44.010
But he was a neighbor of mine in
England, and immensely wealthy.

00:00:44.010 --> 00:00:46.413 size:81% position:41%
I mean, he was an heir
to the Getty fortune.

00:00:46.413 --> 00:00:48.815 size:81% position:41%
Petrol, you know, gas.

00:00:48.815 --> 00:00:51.451 size:88% position:44%
And he had a bob or two.

00:00:51.451 --> 00:00:54.788 size:84% position:42%
And I remember arriving
in the car at his gate

00:00:54.788 --> 00:00:58.425 align:start size:94% position:6%
and somebody very kindly
opened the door and I got out.

00:00:58.425 --> 00:01:00.994 align:start size:94% position:6%
My wife got out, and they took
the car away, parked it.

00:01:00.994 --> 00:01:04.030 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then I -- somebody opened
the gate into the garden

00:01:04.030 --> 00:01:05.432
and I went through the garden.

00:01:05.432 --> 00:01:07.967 align:start size:94% position:6%
Somebody opened -- another man
opened the front door.

00:01:07.967 --> 00:01:09.169 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I went inside.

00:01:09.169 --> 00:01:10.970 align:start size:94% position:6%
And there was another man
who took my coat,

00:01:10.970 --> 00:01:12.305 size:75% position:38%
took my wife´s coat,

00:01:12.305 --> 00:01:14.474
and another man who stood there
with some champagne.

00:01:14.474 --> 00:01:15.742 align:start size:94% position:6%
I get champagne.

00:01:15.742 --> 00:01:17.777
And another man who opened
the doors into the party.

00:01:17.777 --> 00:01:18.812 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Light laughter ]

00:01:18.812 --> 00:01:20.780 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I thought, you know,
"It´s wonderful."

00:01:20.780 --> 00:01:21.915 size:84% position:42%
They were all ex-S.A.S.

00:01:21.915 --> 00:01:23.049 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, really?
-Yeah.

00:01:23.049 --> 00:01:24.350
-So that´s like Special Forces?

00:01:24.350 --> 00:01:25.385 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-Okay.

00:01:25.385 --> 00:01:27.187 align:start size:94% position:6%
-They were all there
to guard him.

00:01:27.187 --> 00:01:28.254 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh.

00:01:28.254 --> 00:01:29.622 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And I thought,
"That´s my Alfred."

00:01:29.622 --> 00:01:32.058
-Oh, you wanted to be like
an Alfred who´s ex-military.

00:01:32.058 --> 00:01:33.193 size:81% position:41%
&gt;&gt; Yeah. That´s right.

00:01:33.193 --> 00:01:35.195 align:start size:94% position:6%
He´s a guy who can sort of
do anything.

00:01:35.195 --> 00:01:37.464 align:start size:94% position:6%
But also he can make you
a good cup of coffee.

00:01:37.464 --> 00:01:38.164 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, I see.

00:01:38.164 --> 00:01:40.700
-But he has that history.

00:01:40.700 --> 00:01:44.304
I mean, in the movie, of course,
the great thing about Alfred

00:01:44.304 --> 00:01:46.272 align:start size:94% position:6%
is he doesn´t believe
in green screen.

00:01:46.272 --> 00:01:47.540 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, right.

00:01:47.540 --> 00:01:49.476
So you don´t have to fight
anybody that´s not there.

00:01:49.476 --> 00:01:50.844
You just work on a computer.

00:01:50.844 --> 00:01:51.611 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That´s right.

00:01:51.611 --> 00:01:52.712 size:75% position:38%
I don´t have to fly.

00:01:52.712 --> 00:01:54.814
I don´t have stand in front with
sort of --

00:01:54.814 --> 00:01:56.983 align:start size:94% position:6%
you probably know how they do
green screen.

00:01:56.983 --> 00:01:58.818 align:start size:94% position:6%
But it´s very tedious
for an actor.

00:01:58.818 --> 00:02:00.720 align:start size:94% position:6%
Wonderful effects.
Amazing effects.

00:02:00.720 --> 00:02:03.790 align:start size:94% position:6%
But I don´t have to do that.
I´m the guy at home.

00:02:03.790 --> 00:02:07.927
And I´m very pleased about that.

00:02:07.927 --> 00:02:09.896 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So you don´t mind that
you´re in a superhero movie

00:02:09.896 --> 00:02:11.865 size:75% position:38%
and you´re not doing
any superhero stuff.

00:02:11.865 --> 00:02:13.700 align:start size:94% position:6%
-No, no.
-You´re basically Googling --

00:02:13.700 --> 00:02:15.668 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Because I know --
I know the underneath.

00:02:15.668 --> 00:02:17.770 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, okay.
-You know, underneath.

00:02:17.770 --> 00:02:19.472 align:start size:94% position:6%
-[ Laughing ] Okay.

00:02:19.472 --> 00:02:22.108
-Alfred is the...superhero.

00:02:22.108 --> 00:02:23.376 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, I see.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:23.376 --> 00:02:24.511 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I know that.

00:02:24.511 --> 00:02:25.812 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So we should go knowing...
-Yeah, yeah.

00:02:25.812 --> 00:02:27.614 size:78% position:39%
-...that the rest of
it´s all just a show.

00:02:27.614 --> 00:02:28.681 size:88% position:44%
-Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:02:28.681 --> 00:02:30.216 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Alfred´s the real guy.
-Yeah, yeah.

00:02:30.216 --> 00:02:32.085 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Do you yourself--
are you tech-savvy?

00:02:32.085 --> 00:02:33.219 align:start size:94% position:6%
-No.
-Okay.

00:02:33.219 --> 00:02:34.954 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I know nothing about it.
-Nothing about it.

00:02:34.954 --> 00:02:37.257 size:84% position:42%
-No. I can get e-mails.

00:02:37.257 --> 00:02:38.525 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, congrats!
-And send them.

00:02:38.525 --> 00:02:39.726 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, wow, wow.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:39.726 --> 00:02:41.895 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah. And I can --
I can do mobile phones.

00:02:41.895 --> 00:02:42.996 align:start size:94% position:6%
-All right.
-Yeah.

00:02:42.996 --> 00:02:44.797 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, that is
how they work so...

00:02:44.797 --> 00:02:45.999 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:45.999 --> 00:02:48.301
-I was going to ask --
you can do mobile phones?

00:02:48.301 --> 00:02:50.136 align:start size:94% position:6%
Show me how they work.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:50.136 --> 00:02:53.306
-But the other day
I had to call down to the hotel.

00:02:53.306 --> 00:02:54.941
I was staying in a hotel.

00:02:54.941 --> 00:02:58.811
I had to call down to see how
the VCR worked to get a DVD on.

00:02:58.811 --> 00:03:00.513 align:start size:94% position:6%
I couldn´t do that.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:00.513 --> 00:03:01.881 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Wow.
-Yeah.

00:03:01.881 --> 00:03:03.983 align:start size:94% position:6%
I mean, I would say the
beginning is if it was a VCR,

00:03:03.983 --> 00:03:05.585 align:start size:94% position:6%
that´s why
the DVD wasn´t working.

00:03:05.585 --> 00:03:07.453 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:07.453 --> 00:03:10.790
You also, you know, we can see,
you know, you and Ben Affleck

00:03:10.790 --> 00:03:12.125 align:start size:94% position:6%
were both in sort of
regular clothes,

00:03:12.125 --> 00:03:14.794
but you don´t ever have to wear
the costume either.

00:03:14.794 --> 00:03:16.296 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I don´t.
-Is that great?

00:03:16.296 --> 00:03:18.598 size:81% position:41%
-Oh, it´s wonderful!
We shot in the summer.

00:03:18.598 --> 00:03:21.568 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know, and they´re all very
big people, apart from Gal,

00:03:21.568 --> 00:03:22.802 size:84% position:42%
who plays Wonder Woman.

00:03:22.802 --> 00:03:24.304 align:start size:94% position:6%
But they´re very,
very big people, anyway,

00:03:24.304 --> 00:03:26.773 align:start size:94% position:6%
but then they wear
these enormous costumes.

00:03:26.773 --> 00:03:29.676 size:88% position:44%
Sort of great, sort of
rubber things, you know.

00:03:29.676 --> 00:03:32.579
Huge, which is sweltering.

00:03:32.579 --> 00:03:34.847 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-Absolutely sweltering.

00:03:34.847 --> 00:03:38.618
And, you know, I´m sitting there
in a shirt and sort of smiling.

00:03:38.618 --> 00:03:41.254 align:start size:94% position:6%
But they have to --
when they stop acting,

00:03:41.254 --> 00:03:44.324 align:start size:94% position:6%
they back up to
this sort of machine

00:03:44.324 --> 00:03:47.894 size:84% position:42%
and they´re plugged in,
and water, cold water,

00:03:47.894 --> 00:03:49.996 align:start size:94% position:6%
is sent through the inside,
through pipes,

00:03:49.996 --> 00:03:51.864
so it´s like a Frigidaire.

00:03:51.864 --> 00:03:53.266 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Light laughter ]

00:03:53.266 --> 00:03:55.635 size:88% position:44%
And it cools them down.
I don´t have to do that.

00:03:55.635 --> 00:03:56.836 size:88% position:44%
-Yeah, that´s wonderful.

00:03:56.836 --> 00:03:58.972 align:start size:94% position:6%
I wonder if the real Batman
has to do that.

00:03:58.972 --> 00:04:01.407 align:start size:94% position:6%
´Cause that makes him seem
a lot less cool, too.

00:04:01.407 --> 00:04:03.876
-Yeah, well, I suspect he has to
do one or two things

00:04:03.876 --> 00:04:05.011 size:75% position:38%
we don´t know about.

00:04:05.011 --> 00:04:06.212 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, that´s true.
That´s a good point.

